flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>Multi objective optimization flow"]
DecisionVars["**Decision Variables**<br/>Six buffer capacities per run<br/>Discrete range {1-10}"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>Minimize WIP<br/>Maximize Throughput"]
Problem["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>Attributes<br/>n_var 6<br/>n_obj 2<br/>xl array {1-10}<br/>xu array {1-10}<br/>n_replications base_seed n_cores<br/>Methods<br/>_evaluate evaluate population using multiprocessing pool"]
NSGA2Alg["**NSGA2 Algorithm**<br/>Attributes<br/>pop_size n_gen sampling SBX mutation PM<br/>Methods<br/>run minimize problem and build history"]
Evaluator["**Evaluator**<br/>evaluate_single_individual function<br/>Inputs caps seed n_replications warmup measure_until<br/>Methods<br/>run replications call run_simulation_with_caps aggregate metrics"]
RunSimCaps["**run_simulation_with_caps**<br/>Inputs caps seed warmup measure_until<br/>Methods<br/>build environment create DelayBuffers create Machines run warmup sample WIP return metrics dict"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer**<br/>Attributes<br/>cap delay store tokens in_transit<br/>Methods<br/>put delayed_put get get_and_release free_capacity in_transit_count"]
MachineClass["**Machine**<br/>Attributes<br/>name input_buffer output_buffer process_time availability mttr working_power waiting_power capacity resource stats repair_event is_up<br/>Methods<br/>run breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption reset_machine_stats"]
SimulationRunner["**Simulation Runner**<br/>run_simulation wrapper for baseline experiments<br/>Part generator WIP sampler warmup and measurement phases"]
Exporter["**Results Exporter**<br/>export_history_to_csv<br/>Methods<br/>collect history iterate generations write CSV results"]
Pool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Attributes<br/>processes n_cores<br/>Methods<br/>map evaluate tasks in parallel"]

Start --> DecisionVars
DecisionVars --> Problem
Problem --> Objectives
Problem --> NSGA2Alg
NSGA2Alg --> Problem
NSGA2Alg --> Pool
Problem --> Pool
Pool --> Evaluator
Evaluator --> RunSimCaps
RunSimCaps --> DelayBufferClass
RunSimCaps --> MachineClass
RunSimCaps --> SimulationRunner
SimulationRunner --> MachineClass
SimulationRunner --> DelayBufferClass
Evaluator --> SimulationRunner
Problem --> NSGA2Alg
NSGA2Alg --> Exporter
Exporter --> Start

%% Interaction notes shown as flow nodes for clarity
Interaction1["**Optimization Loop**<br/>Population generation evaluation selection crossover mutation"] 
Interaction2["**Evaluation Result**<br/>Objective vector [avg WIP , -avg Throughput] returned to Problem"]
Interaction3["**Design Decision**<br/>Adjusted capacities returned by algorithm as candidate solutions"]

NSGA2Alg --> Interaction1
Pool --> Interaction2
Interaction2 --> Problem
Problem --> Interaction3
Interaction3 --> NSGA2Alg